# accounts.local: this host's clients, for the account checks, the statusline and
# memory-scope. Copy this file to accounts.local at the checkout root and list the real
# clients there. Git ignores that copy, so client names stay out of this public repo.
# Format and matching rules: bin/accounts-lookup.sh.
#
# kind    match                       account  segment   label
marker    clientco                    bs       clientco  Clientco Enterprise
remote    *github.com[:/]clientco/*   bs       clientco  Clientco Enterprise
org       clientco                    bs       -         Clientco Enterprise
